      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}\n\nThe passage argues that China chose not to prioritize gunpowder weapons due to specific strategic needs against mobile nomads, rather than ignoring their benefits. This challenges the traditional view that China fell behind Europe because of a failure to recognize or adopt technological advancements. Instead, it suggests the divergence was a rational response to different military threats.",
