      "generated_answer": "The provided text discusses the structure of the church, the role of the Pope and cardinals, their wealth, and the need for reform, but it does not mention the specific controversy regarding the sale of indulgences. Therefore, this topic is the one avoided in this particular excerpt.\n\n\\boxed{B}",
