vision for an impartial neutrality.\nH. It was unanimously approved by the United States Senate.\nI. The United States Senate rejected it because it did not address the issue of neutrality.\nJ. It was never voted on by the United States Senate.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
