      "generated_answer": "The poem describes the imperial mission as \"heavy harness\" and involving \"savage wars,\" yet frames it as a duty to bring order and aid (\"Famine,\" \"sickness\") to those deemed \"uncivilized.\" This aligns with the concept of a difficult burden that must be carried out despite the challenges and lack of immediate gratitude, rather than being purely profitable, hopeless, or solely religious. Therefore, the best summary is that it is a difficult but necessary task.\n\n\\boxed{F}",
