    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\n```python\nfrom sys import stdin, stdout\nfrom collections import defaultdict\n\ndef find(parent, i):\n    if parent[i] == i:\n        return i\n    else:\n        parent[i] = find(parent, parent[i])\n        return parent[i]\n\ndef union(parent, rank, x, y):\n    xroot = find(parent, x)\n    yroot = find(parent, y)\n    \n    if xroot != yroot:\n        if rank[xroot] < rank[yroot]:\n            parent[xroot] = yroot\n        elif rank[xroot] > rank[yroot]:\n            parent[yroot] = xroot\n        else:\n            parent[yroot] = xroot\n            rank[xroot] += 1\n        return True\n    return False\n\ndef solve():\n    input = stdin.read().split()\n    idx = 0\n    \n    N = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n    M = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n    \n    parent = list(range(N + 1))\n    rank = [0] * (N + 1)\n    \n    for _ in range(M):\n        u = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        v = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        union(parent, rank, u, v)\n    \n    K = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n    blocked = set()\n    for _ in range(K):\n        x = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        y = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        blocked.add((min(x, y), max(x, y)))\n    \n    Q = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n    results = []\n    for _ in range(Q):\n        p = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        q = int(input[idx]); idx += 1\n        \n        if (min(p, q), max(p, q)) in blocked:\n            results.append(\"No\")\n            continue\n        \n        if union(parent, rank, p, q):\n            # Check if any blocked pair becomes connected\n            for (x, y) in blocked.copy():\n                if find(parent, x) == find(parent, y):\n                    results.append(\"No\")\n                    blocked.remove((x, y))\n                    break\n            else:\n                results.append(\"Yes\")\n        else:\n            results.append(\"No\")\n    \n    stdout.write(\"\\n\".join(results) + \"\\n\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
