      "generated_answer": "To find the implied total value of Latapack-Ball, I need to determine what the 10.1% economic interest was worth and then extrapolate to 100%.\n\nFrom the context:\n- Ball paid $46.2 million for a 10.1% economic interest in Latapack-Ball\n- This means $46.2 million represents 10.1% of the total joint venture value\n\nCalculation:\n- Implied total value = $46.2 million ÷ 10.1% = $46.2 / 0.101 = $457.43 million\n\n\\boxed{457.43}",
