    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\nThe wormhole appeared near Saturn 48 years earlier than the events of the story taking place. This timeline is established by Dr. Brand's explanation to Joseph Cooper, stating that the wormhole mysteriously appeared 48 years prior, creating a pathway to a distant galaxy.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{48 years earlier}}",
