      "generated_answer": "\nNick and his family move to a trailer park because Jerry owes money to a group of sailors and relocates them there to address this debt. This move occurs early in the story and is the primary reason for the change in living situation.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Jerry owes money to a group of sailors and moves the family to the trailer park to deal with this debt.}}",
