      "generated_answer": "\nThe phrase \"In pace requiescat\" is a Latin expression that translates to \"Rest in peace.\" It is commonly used in epitaphs or memorials to wish the deceased a peaceful rest in the afterlife.\n\n\\boxed{\\text{Rest in peace}}",
