      "generated_answer": "\n\\boxed{To get soap to clean herself.} Patsy sneaked off to Mistress Shaw's house because she needed soap for personal hygiene, as the plantation provided inadequate cleaning supplies for the enslaved people. This act of seeking basic necessities without Epps's permission led to her punishment, highlighting the harsh control slave owners exerted over even minor aspects of enslaved life.",
