    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\nThe excerpt from the Sugar Act of 1764 focuses on raising revenue through specific duties to fund defense and secure commerce. Option C, the protective tariffs during the Industrial Revolution, involves similar revenue-generating measures aimed at protecting trade and industry, making it the most aligned with the goals.\n\n\\boxed{C}",
