ogies\nD. The Tang Dynasty's strong bureaucracy at the local level\nE. The Tang Dynasty's economic prosperity due to high taxation\nF. The Tang Dynasty's lack of regular income due to unpaid taxes\nG. The Tang Dynasty's system of land distribution based on taxation\nH. The Tang Dynasty's heavy reliance on conscription to meet military needs\nI. The Tang Dynasty's system of forced labor in lieu of taxation\nJ. The relatively high level of urbanization in Tang China\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
